  "unsupported_note": "These materials are commonly used as catalyst supports but are NOT covered by Nuss & Eckelman 2014 (Table S38 limits coverage to elements and a subset of their oxide supply forms). Until additional verified LCI sources are added, the LCA engine returns a data_gap warning instead of an estimated value for these supports. Do not invent values."
